			"notes": "## fix: resolve item ghosting and implement vanilla conversion for Servux data  \n\n- Updated project compatibility for Minecraft 1.21.11.\n- Refactored core conversion logic to eliminate item ghosting (desync) issues.\n- Implemented a robust NBT filtering system to sanitize modded data sent via Servux.\n- Added full support for Polymer and Filament items, ensuring they are correctly mapped to vanilla counterparts for mod-less clients.\n- Introduced a caching mechanism (ConcurrentHashMap) to optimize performance during deep NBT scans.\n- Fixed an issue where modded IDs were improperly wrapped in Optional strings, causing client-side crashes."
		},
